# Does a GDML build, and does anything overlap?  (see README.md)
/RMG/Geometry/GDMLDisableOverlapCheck {SKIP}        # true: build only; false: also scan for overlaps
/RMG/Geometry/GDMLOverlapCheckNumPoints {NPOINTS}   # surface points per volume in the scan
/RMG/Geometry/IncludeGDMLFile {GDML}
/run/initialize
